 gto.com/events/2026/05/16/original_imagee658622d-75f4-422c-b5a0-5cc0f4e006
 97.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Afro Brasilica is a multidisciplinary creative residency that 
 champions sound\, movement and conversation. Rooted in music\, including b
 ut not limited to: Brazilian Samba\, Afro-Latin\, Latin Jazz and more\, th
 e project expands on the idea of community cultivation through shared expr
 ession within CONTXT.\nThrough dynamic DJ sets\, visual art\, poetry\, dia
 logue\, guest performances\, spirited libations and curated tapas\, Afro B
 rasilica weaves a limitless\, intentional approach like the rings of its l
 atter-namesake wood\; intricate and unique\, yet\, connected and intersect
 ional.\nMay 21\, 2026 with Guest DJ Nyhtnurse\nThis residency is curated\,
  hosted and produced by Trust The Process Press.\nPWYC (RSVP) - Thursdays 
 - Doors 7:00 pm\, Show: 8:00 pm
LOCATION:CONTXT by Trane
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/afro-brasilica-toronto-3/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
