BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spotlight Sessions
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260521T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260521T233000
UID:blogto-234958@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/13/original_imagede409e79-f0ab-49c3-bf09-4785f2a14a
 09.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Hi blogTO team\,\nI’m reaching out to share a story idea abo
 ut *Spotlight Sessions*\, a biweekly open mic series that has been running
  in Toronto since September 2025.\nOver the past several months\, Spotligh
 t Sessions has created a consistent space for emerging artists\, musicians
 \, and spoken word performers to share their work and build community. Wha
 t started as a small gathering has grown into a recurring creative hub wit
 h a loyal audience.\nWe’re now hosting our **final show of the season**\
 , and it’s shaping up to be our biggest night yet. This closing event br
 ings together standout performers from past sessions\, along with new voic
 es\, to celebrate the community that’s been built.\nWe’d love to be co
 nsidered for a feature or event listing to help spotlight local talent and
  mark the end of this chapter—especially as we prepare to expand the ser
 ies and apply for arts funding in the coming year.\n**Event details:**\n* 
 Name: Spotlight Sessions (Season Finale)\n* Date & Time: May 21\, 2026 - 8
 :00pm-Late\n* Location: IDK Social Bar\n* Tickets/Entry: Early Bird RSVPs 
 $15 or $20 at the door\n* Instagram: @spotlight.sessions.to / @the.audio.s
 tation / @realmcyyz\n* Website: https://partiful.com/e/kAB4jhYBpxdaixBhYVi
 m?c=VvJBg1CN\nHappy to provide photos\, videos\, or additional details if 
 helpful.\nThanks so much for your time\,\nLuis Vasquez\nFounder / Organize
 r\, Spotlight Sessions\ntorontoaudiostation@gmail.com
LOCATION:IDK Social Bar
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/spotlight-sessions-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
