 \, The Village at Black Creek transforms from a charming window into the p
 ast into a place of shadowy figures\, phantom footsteps\, and chilling enc
 ounters. On this 75-minute guided tour\, you’ll step inside historic bui
 ldings and hear the true stories of those who never left. Climb the stairs
  of Second House\, where something still lingers. Enter the Manse (if you 
 dare)\, where an angry presence makes itself known. And brave Burwick Hous
 e\, where a grieving spirit may still be searching for her child. Flashlig
 hts are provided. Nerves are not. Not recommended for young children or ea
 sily frightened adults. Tickets are vanishing now. Paid parking only ($10.
