 gto.com/events/2026/05/20/original_imagea6e55de0-14f2-4ea6-a23f-7871dc1716
 50.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Come cheer on your favourites and experience a wild night of A
 IR GUITAR.\nSat May 23\, 2026\nCanadian National Air Guitar Championships\
 nGround Control - 1279 Queen St West\n7pm Doors\nTICKETS: https://www.zeff
 y.com/en-CA/ticketing/canadian-national-air-guitar-championships--2026\nTh
 e Canadian air guitar event of the season is BACK! Witness the face-meltin
 g riffs of Canada's greatest air guitarists from across the country go hea
 d-to-head to see who is most deserving of the the title of 2026 Canadian A
 ir Guitar Champion! The winner will jet off to represent Canada at the 202
 6 Air Guitar World Championships in Oulu\, Finland this August 26-29th!\nA
 ir Guitar is an expression of World Peace - When you are holding an Air Gu
 itar\, you can’t be holding a gun! Air Guitar Canada is a not-for-profit
  and all our events benefit our chosen charity partner. This year\, we're 
 partnering with Food Banks Canada to support fighting hunger across Canada
 ! #MakeAirNotWar\nBring cash to Boost the Ballot\, or shelf-stable food it
 ems to be donated to the Toronto Food Bank to earn yourself some extra vot
 es! Limit of 5 food items per attendee.\nThink you've got what it takes to
  win it all? Sign up to compete as a Dark Horse! Registration for competit
 ors closes May 19th!\nWondering how it all works? Get all the details on o
 ur website! www.airguitarcanada.org\nACCESSIBILITY NOTICE: Ground Control 
 is a first-floor venue accessible with no stairs at the entrance and an ac
 cessible washroom on site. 19+. Alcohol served on site. Unisex bathrooms o
 n site. This show will involve flashing lights and loud music.
LOCATION:Ground Control
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/air-guitar-canadian-national-championshi
 ps-2026-toronto/
