BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beginner Car Mechanics Workshop in North York
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T130000
UID:blogto-234366@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/29/original_imageac4a1b86-f453-4c10-8081-b00b79a931
 7d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Learn basic car mechanics in this hands-on beginner workshop\,
  no experience needed.\nThis 3-hour class gives you the practical skills a
 nd confidence to take care of your own vehicle. Whether you're a new car o
 wner\, tired of relying on someone else\, or just done feeling lost at the
  shop\, this is the course for you. Total beginners welcome\, ages 16+\, i
 n a judgment-free\, supportive space.\nWhat you'll learn:\n✅ Pop the hoo
 d\, check fluids\, replace filters\, and jumpstart an engine\n✅ Change a
  tire\, check tread depth and air pressure\, inflate a tire\, and examine 
 your brakes\n✅ Know-how to keep you safe during roadside emergencies and
  avoid costly repairs\n✅ A simple maintenance plan — you'll work with 
 a mechanic to build a routine that fits your specific vehicle\nWhy people 
 sign up:\nFlat tires\, low oil\, a dead battery - emergencies happen. For 
 a lot of people\, even a routine mechanic visit can feel intimidating. Man
 y of our attendees come in tired of overpaying for simple repairs\, or of 
 having to call someone every time a dashboard light comes on. In three hou
 rs\, you'll have the skills to handle the basics yourself and the confiden
 ce to ask the right questions when you do go to a shop.\nMeet Your Instruc
 tor:\nOur instructor is a licensed mechanic with 20+ years of experience. 
 He has taught auto mechanics to hundreds of students at all levels
LOCATION:Spaces United
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/beginner-car-mechanics-workshop-in-north
 -york-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
