BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brain Power Midtown Campus Open House
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T163000
UID:blogto-234184@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_image040e7cbf-0b9e-4bad-9167-4d3eeb5e66
 24.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Kaitlin Ruether and Dr. Stacy Costa\, Heads of Brain Power Tor
 onto\, are thrilled to invite you to our Midtown Campus at De La Salle Col
 lege\, in Toronto!\nDid you know that our faculty and programs have been h
 elping kids meet their academic potential for over 30 years in Vaughan? No
 w\, we're honoured to be a part of a much larger Brain Power community tha
 t is thriving across eleven campuses and online!\nPlease join us for an op
 portunity to meet and chat with our PhD and expert faculty.\nBut that's no
 t all! During our Open House\, you can also:\nLearn more about the magic o
 f Brain Power's math program.\nDiscover Language Arts Excellence.\nLearn a
 bout our incredible Public Speaking Program.\nMeet members of our leadersh
 ip team\, including campus heads Dr. Stacy and Kaitlin.\nAnd of course\, w
 e'll have light refreshments and snacks for everyone to enjoy. Whether you
 're a current student\, a future one\, or simply curious about what we off
 er\, this event is open to you and your family.\nWe can't wait to see you 
 there! Here are some resources you might want to check out before you join
