 a1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Habibi and Friends is a stand-up comedy show where anything ca
 n happen.\nHosted by Toronto comedian Moe Ismail\, the show features some 
 of the best comedians in the country doing crowd work\, riffing with the a
 udience\, and taking topic suggestions live on stage. Every show ends up g
 oing in a completely different direction depending on who’s in the room 
 and what gets thrown at the comics.\nThe lineup will consist of surprise g
 uest comedians—some of the best in the country—who drop in unannounced
 . We don’t release the lineup ahead of time\, so the only way to find ou
 t who’s on the show is to be in the room.\nIt’s loose\, unpredictable\
 , and a lot more interactive than a typical stand-up show.\nAlong the way\
 , comedians will also be trying out some of their newest material — joke
 s and ideas they’re working on before they make their way into bigger se
 ts\, tours\, or specials.\nExpect quick thinking\, off-the-cuff moments\, 
 and the kind of comedy that only happens when comics are reacting in real 
 time.\nCome hang out\, grab some of the best food and drinks\, and watch s
 ome of the country’s best comedians figure it out live.
