 ull day of inclusive sports where participants of all abilities come toget
 her to compete\, connect\, and raise funds for an incredible cause.\nOn ev
 ent day\, your team will be paired with 1-2 local Special Olympics athlete
 s who will compete alongside you throughout the day. Together\, you’ll t
 ake part in a variety of sports and activities\, including Soccer\, Footba
 ll\, Basketball\, Ultimate Giant pong\, Benchball\, and more.\nWhat’s In
 cluded for Participants:\n- A motionball Under Armour T-shirt and hat\n- L
 ight breakfast\, lunch\, and refreshments\n- A personal fundraising link w
 ith the chance to earn incentive prizes\n- A ticket to the onsite Marathon
  of Sport after-party with live entertainment and drinks\n- An unforgettab
 le experience playing alongside Special Olympics athletes
