 gto.com/events/2026/05/20/original_imagef0fe57cb-644d-44b8-903b-7891a441f7
 de.jpg
DESCRIPTION:THE BEST PUB CRAWL IN TORONTO\nAwarded the Badge of Excellence
  from TripAdvisor as the best pub crawl in the city\nFeatured on BlogTO as
  one of the best ways to meet people in Toronto 🤩\nand…\nParty in the
  funnest spots in the city! 🍻🥂\nParty with fun people! 😍😍😍\
 nWe're headed to 3 really fun amazing spots in the Entertainment District 
 of Toronto and trust us\, you will be very entertained as part of the pub 
 crawl! See you there!\nMEETING POINT\nThai Tavern\, 221 Richmond St W.\nWh
 en you get to the bar\, ask a server where the pub crawl is (i.e. us) and 
 they will direct you.\nPARTY AGENDA\n➡️ 9pm-10pm- Mingling with the Pu
 b Crawl at our first bar of the night! Plus\, get drink deals exclusive to
  Pub Crawl Toronto guests!\n➡️ 10pm-11pm- Fun times at the 2nd stop of
  the night with yet more drink deals exclusive to Pub Crawl Toronto guests
 !\n➡️ 11pm-Close- Party the rest of the night away at our 3rd and fina
 l stop of the night\, a nightclub to dance the night away to awesome music
 ! Plus\, Pub Crawl Toronto guests get FREE ENTRY to the club too! Nice!\nH
 OW WE’RE DIFFERENT (And the best\, in our opinion! 😀😀)\n➡️ Our
  prices will not increase between now and the pub crawl\n➡️ Real drink
  specials exclusive to Pub Crawl Toronto- these are deals you won't get wi
 thout a ticket to the crawl!\n➡️ We don’t ditch pub crawlers at the 
 door of the first stop of the night. Our host will be guiding the crawl th
 roughout\, to help ensure everyone has an amazing time!\n➡️ Everyone m
 oves together on the crawl\, making it a great and easy way to meet everyo
 ne!\n➡️ Every bar/club we are going to is less than 5 mins walking fro
 m the next one making things super easy for you!\nSee you there!!\nLOGISTI
 CAL DETAILS\n➡️ There is a dress code- No ballcaps\, sweatshirts\, jer
 seys\, sweatpants\, ripped jeans\, baggy cargo pants or running shoes. If 
 you don't get into the bars/clubs we go to\, the pub crawl is not responsi
 ble for you!\n➡️ The club we are going to is 21+. So if you don't get 
 in\, the pub crawl is not responsible for you!\n➡️ Every bar/club we a
 re going to is less than 5 mins walking from the next one. So don’t worr
 y about needing to walk any sort of long distance.\n➡️ Make sure to co
 me early so you can socialize with the group before things get crazy!\nGET
  YOUR TICKETS HERE- pubcrawltoronto.com/book-now/
LOCATION:Tha Phae Tavern
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/pub-crawl-toronto-toronto-202/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
