 ce decide on which characters you want to see do a hilarious improv scene 
 together. Maybe Linda Belcher will be in a pitch meeting with Walt Disney.
  Maybe Rocky will be roommates with a Muppet. Any pairing can happen\, as 
 long as the audience decides it wants to see those Worlds Collide!\nShows 
 May 23rd\, June 20th at 7:30PM in The John Candy Box Theatre\, 1 York St.\
