 ainment.com/worlds-collide\nWorlds Collide is hosted by Maddox Campbell an
 d produced by Kicks and Giggles Entertainment\, the same people behind sho
 ws that have been making people laugh for years like Perfect Match\, The K
 now Show\, and The Resistance: Improvised. You can find more info about Wo
 rlds Collide and our other projects at kicksandgigglesentertainment.com
