  many styles of Jewish Music - Klezmer\, Cantorial\, Sephardic\, Yiddish\,
 \nMiddle-Eastern\, Israeli\, Yiddish -  as well as the Jewish contribution
  to your favourite mainstream musical genres including Broadway\, Jazz\, C
 lassical\, Opera\, Rock\, Pop.\nThere's something for every musical taste\
 , and all daytime events are free!\nFlip through the Program Guide on webs
 ite for details\, and enjoy planning your week!
