 ub. Located in the heart of the city\, Gibbons brings the spirit of a clas
 sic public house to a contemporary setting\, offering a welcoming atmosphe
 re perfect for building new connections.\nFor this event\, we have secured
  "The Snug\," a charming private area within the pub. It provides the idea
 l intimate backdrop for our members to relax\, share a meal\, and engage i
 n meaningful conversation away from the main bustle.\nThe Feast: We are ga
 thering for a traditional Sunday Roast—a staple of Irish comfort. One of
  the key features on the menu is a traditional and hearty Irish roast serv
 ed with all the classic fixings including roasted sirloin\, caramelized mu
 shrooms and onions\, mashed potato\, rich gravy\, and seasonal vegetables.
  If you prefer something different\, the full menu is also available for a
 -la-carte ordering.\nDrink Pairings: To round out the experience\, choose 
 from a curated selection of beers\, ciders\, and wines to wash down your f
 east.\nWhether you are an existing member or joining us for the first time
 \, this is a wonderful opportunity to get to know your fellow club members
  over a shared table.\nSpace is limited in The Snug\, so please RSVP to se
 cure your spot at the table!\nThe Social Couple™ is dedicated to curatin
 g sophisticated and engaging experiences for couples — from exclusive ch
 ef-curated dinners and private social events to exciting day trips. This n
 ew venture is designed for couples looking to build new friendships and en
 joy a curated sophisticated social calendar.\nemail: info@jointhesocialcou
 ple.com\nwebsite: https://jointhesocialcouple.com/comingsoon
