  dining menu served throughout the night (included with your ticket)\n-A l
 ineup of standout designers presenting live collections\n-Live DJ sets and
  integrated entertainment showcases (magic show\, live band\, & more)\n-Ac
 cess to Vendor Market + sponsored activations\n-Content-worthy moments thr
 oughout the evening\nMagnolia has grown into a platform for rising creativ
 e talent — bringing together designers\, models\, stylists\, artists\, a
 nd tastemakers under one roof. Each edition builds on the last\, and Magno
 lia IV pushes things further with a more immersive\, intentional format. W
 hether you’re here for the fashion\, the food\, or the full experience 
 — this is where it all connects.\nDress Code: Neo-Noir (Guests are encou
 raged to arrive in statement looks\, but keep a black/dark palette)\nSound
 s By: DJ GALLO\, DJ LONE C\, DJ Z-SPINS\nDesigners/Curators\nSanka Crochet
