BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TANGO x TANGO - May Tablao 2026  "An Encounter Between Argentine T
 ango and Flamenco"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260524T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260525T053000
UID:blogto-234090@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/23/original_image0906e289-a6c7-42aa-9a51-2b47c06c84
 be.jpg
DESCRIPTION:For Flamenco\, 'Tango' is a palo (a specific style of the art 
 form). But for many people\, 'Tango’ might mean Argentine Tango.... so w
 hat's the difference? 🤔\nBoth Argentine Tango and Flamenco originated i
 n marginalized communities and immigrant cultures in the late 19th and ear
 ly 20th centuries\, and are defined by their passion\, melancholy\, and im
 provisational nature.\nPherhaps the key difference lies here - both are pa
 ssionate\, but Argentine Tango centers on the connection with a partner\, 
 while Flamenco emphasizes an inner confrontation with oneself.....\nCuriou
 s? Come experience it for yourself! 😉\nFeaturing Argentine Tango dancer
 s Junko Mita Bodie and Pedro De Oliveira\, alongside violinist Aparna Halp
 é and the Toronto Tango Community Orchestra\, with all music arranged by 
 Elena Losseva.\nJoining them for flamenco are acclaimed local musicians An
 a Lía and Nicolas Hernandez\, with flamenco dance by Kiyo Asaoka.\nDon't 
 miss this exciting and unique performance!\nAnd as always\, if you dine at
  Rivoli before the show\, YOUR SEAT WILL BE RESERVED\, plus you'll receive
  a 10% discount on your meal.\nTo take advantage of this Win-Win-Deal🏆\
 , please contact TablaoFlamencoToronto@gmail.com
LOCATION:Rivoli
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/tango-x-tango-may-tablao-2026-an-encount
 er-between-argentine-tango-and-flamenco-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
