 7c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This event honours the life and legacy of His Holiness the 14t
 h Dalai Lama during the year-long celebration of his 90th birthday. As Tib
 etans and followers worldwide dedicate the year from July 6\, 2025\, to Ju
 ly 6\, 2026\, to His Holiness\, this Toronto event is a proud part of the 
 global celebration.\nThis is a free event on May 24th\, 2026 (Sunday) from
  10:00 am - 6:00 pm where public can experience the richness of Tibetan cu
 lture through mesmerizing throat singing from Tibetan buddhist monks\, tra
 ditional performing arts\, and a mini-market. Public can also savor popula
 r Tibetan dishes like momo\, and most importantly explore a special photo 
 exhibition showcasing the life and legacy of His Holiness the 14th Dalai L
 ama.
