 54.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Learn the art of sentiment while building an artifact that rep
 resents you. This is a workshop/talk about creating physical memories :)\n
 This workshop introduces participants to the art of sentiment and how ever
 yday objects\, textures\, and fragments can hold emotional meaning. Throug
 h guided reflection and hands-on creation\, participants will build a smal
 l physical artifact that represents who they are or a moment that shaped t
