 gto.com/events/2026/05/13/original_imagec6d0f668-8359-4409-b5c7-631ec1ec92
 0a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:​Join Synergi Club on May 26\, 2026 for an exclusive evening
  designed for women with careers across tech\, finance\, and consulting. F
 rom boardrooms to startups\, from strategic deals to scaling tech products
 \, these are the women shaping what's next in the new age of AI. They lead
  teams\, drive innovation\, and build the new future.\n​Who Should Atten
 d\n​Women with 5+ YOE who currently or in the past worked across:\n​Te
 ch: Operators at startups\, scale-ups\, or tech companies\n​Finance: Inv
 estment banking\, private equity\, Big 4\, corporate finance\, asset manag
 ement\n​Consulting: Strategy\, operations\, tech\, and management consul
 ting\n​Roles include: Manager\, Director\, VP\, Principal\, Partner\n​
 Attendees are looking for:\n​🤝 Peer-level connections with ambitious 
 professionals\n​💡 Insights on innovation\, leadership\, and shaping i
 ndustries\n​✨ A curated\, high-caliber networking experience\n​Agend
 a\n​🕕 5:30 – 5:45 PM · Arrival & Check-In\n​🎤 5:45 – 6:15 P
 M · Speakers + Q&A\n​🤝 6:15 – 7:30 PM · Networking & Connections\
 n​Hosted By\n​Elena D. Kaiache – Founder of Synergi Club\, ex Direct
 or of Strategic Finance at an AI startup\, and former management consultan
 t who led 40+ M&A and strategy projects for private equity clients. Connec
 t with her on LinkedIn\n​About Synergi Club\n​Synergi Club is a privat
 e\, curated network and career platform for professionals across the USA a
 nd Canada with backgrounds in consulting\, Big 4\, IB\, BizOps\, and adjac
 ent fields.\n​Members gain access to:\n✅ Honest conversations about ca
 reer moves\, money\, work-life balance\, and life transitions\n✅ Curated
  peer connections via coffee chats\, online discussions\, and in-person ev
 ents\n✅ Real insights from professionals navigating exits to tech\, star
 tups\, entrepreneurship\, or unconventional paths\n✅ Workshops\, skill-b
 uilding sessions\, and paid mentorship opportunities\n✅ Founding member 
 perks: complimentary membership during soft launch\, priority event access
 \, and recognition on the website\n​📌 Stay Connected with Synergi Clu
 b\n​📅 Apply here for priority waitlist to become a founding member\n
 🔗 Follow Synergi Club on LinkedIn\n📩 Subscribe to our newsletter for
  updates\n​Photography & Videography Notice\n​By registering\, you con
 sent to being photographed and filmed. Media may be shared on social media
  and other platforms.\n​Marketing Notice\n​By registering\, you consen
 t to receiving event updates and marketing emails. You can opt-out any tim
 e.\n​Corporate Partner Opportunities\n​Interested in putting your bran
 d in front of a curated audience of women leaders in tech\, finance\, and 
 consulting? Benefits include branding\, access to high-caliber professiona
 ls\, and association with a premium event. Contact us here.\n​Speaker Op
 portunities\n​We’re looking for women leaders to share insights on inn
 ovation\, leadership\, and career growth. Contact us here.
