BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening of Spirits at Storm Crow Manor - A Blood On the Clockto
 wer Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T223000
UID:blogto-235129@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/16/original_imagea888cab4-dc9a-44f9-80aa-750609b22d
 f7.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of social 
 deception games\, this event offers something for everyone. Come solo or w
 ith friends and immerse yourself in a game of Blood on the Clocktower. Our
  events are a great way to connect with members of local communities and a
 re perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to make new connections.\
 nWhat is Blood on the Clocktower? - Blood on the Clocktower is an advanced
  version of the game Werewolf\, where crucially\, the dead still have an i
 mportant role to play in the game. The game is run by a Storyteller who ha
 s carefully crafted an experience and facilitates the game for up to 20 pl
 ayers. It is part deduction and part deception. Set in the town of Ravensw
 ood Bluff\, players in the game assume different roles\, each with unique 
 abilities to hunt down evil or manipulate the townsfolk.\nFor this particu
 lar event\, themed outfits are required that invoke a sense of spooky soph
 istication. Think refined\, dark\, and moody vintage\, all leaning towards
  mysterious rather than gory or cartoonish.\nThanks to the generosity of S
 torm Crow Manor\, we will be enjoying the use of their Red Rum Room for ou
 r evening of social deduction in Blood on the Clocktower. Included in your
  ticket is one drink and some select appetizers from the Storm Crow Manor 
 menu\, and you are welcome to order more while we’re having fun deceivin
 g and deducing. Tickets for this event are $55 or $48.50 for Changeling Sp
 ecial Events Members.\nIf you have not played before or are newer to the g
 ame\, there will be a quick tutorial at the top of the event to learn how 
 to play and ask any questions from the Storyteller.\nWe will be playing th
 e custom beginner+ script Dark and Stormy at this event.\nAge recommendati
 on\, 16 years +\nTo learn more\, find Changeling Gaming Events Toronto on 
 Eventbrite or click the website link to see this event (see right side on 
 desktop/above on mobile).
LOCATION:Storm Crow Manor Toronto
