 34.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Music of Survival  with Alon Ohel\, former  hostage\, songwrit
 er and pianist.\nDirect from Israel\; it’s a powerful\, unforgettable ev
 ening\, featuring music from a\nmusician who has survived the unimaginable
 !\n24 year old pianist Alon Ohel was abducted from the Nova Music Festival
  October 2023\nand was released only this past October. Surviving 738 days
  in Hamas captivity\, he\nendured long periods of isolation underground\, 
 malnutrition\, and injury.\nIn this triumphant evening\, Alon will share n
 ot only his music but his inspiring\nstory of survival.\nJoined by his bro
 ther Ronen on guitar\, Alon will demonstrate the incredible power of\nmusi
 c oto heal. He offers a quiet\, yet powerful reminder of resilience\, heal
 ing\, and hope.\nThis extraordinary event also features Alon and Ronan in 
 conversation with Avi Benlolo\,\nFounding chairman and CEO of the Abraham 
 Global Peace  Initiative.\nPurchase tickets:  jmweek.ca/alonohel\n$54\, $7
 2\, $180\nLocation to be shared 24hrs before event
LOCATION:Toronto
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/annual-jewish-music-week-presents-music-
 of-survival-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
