 b1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Create a fun small tapestry with crochet artist Maia Camara!\n
 Introduction to Tapestry Crochet with Maia Camara\nApply crochet technique
 s such as colourwork to bring your art to life! Let's make your very first
  tapestry!\nDiscover all the basics of tapestry crochet! In this workshop\
 , we will be using a simple grid chart to transform into a cute tapestry! 
 Crochet techniques such as building rows and colour changing will be pract
 iced as we craft a small tapestry to take home:)\nWhat you’ll learn:\nDi
 fferent methods to create grid patterns\nHow to read grid charts\nBuilding
  rows and colour-changing methods\nCarrying yarn vs weaving in ends to cre
 ate a seamless image\nSupplies needed:\nTwo colours of medium yarn (weight
  4)\n5.0mm hook\nScissors\nDarning needle\n✨KITS AVAILABLE✨\nDon't hav
 e supplies? Kits are available for a $10 “Add-on” and contain everythi
 ng you need:\n-2 small skeins of medium cotton yarn (2 colours)\n-5.0mm cr
 ochet hook\n-scissors and darning needle\nApply the Add-on kit on the “A
 dditional items” page after you select your ticket! <3\nPrerequisites\nB
 asic knowledge of chain stitch and single crochet stitch is helpful <3
