SUMMARY:Free job fair at the Riverdale Hub!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T150000
UID:blogto-235265@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/20/original_imagefbb2e6ad-0f44-494c-b3c9-5a766fb8d1
 26.jpg
DESCRIPTION:After a massive turnout in April with over 150 job seekers\, w
 e’re back to connect you with employers in Security\, Finance\, Manufact
 uring and more. This isn't just about handing out resumes\; it's about dir
 ect conversations\, on-site screenings\, and discovering roles that haven'
 t even hit the job boards yet. Whether you're a newcomer\, a recent grad\,
  or a seasoned professional looking for a change\, come grab a coffee and 
