 le innovations in plant sciences and global environmental stewardship. Thi
 s event will serve as a premier platform for plant biologists\, biotechnol
 ogists\, agricultural scientists\, environmental specialists\, ecologists\
 , industry experts\, policymakers\, investors\, and students to engage in 
