BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sensory Reset: A Sound Bath Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260528T213000
UID:blogto-235053@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/14/original_imagec9435024-08be-4a2b-989d-3a4a3a5225
 16.jpg
DESCRIPTION:An evening curated to help navigate the experience of modern o
 verstimulation: discussion and sensory exploration.\nThe Sensory Reset: A 
 Sound Bath Experience\nWelcome to tinglesbar Hangouts - a series of unique
  and interactive sensory experiences with other ASMR fans - this time\, st
 ep inward. Take an evening to observe a holistic sensory experience\, feat
 uring sounds by local creative K3N-Ē\nWhat to Expect:\n⁠😌Sensory exp
 loration: Engage with the sounds\, textures\, scents\, tastes\, and sights
  of your surroundings as an observer of your own experience.\n💬 Q&A: Pa
 rticipate in or enjoy observing a guided discussion on the topic of intent
 ional presence and navigating modern overstimulation\n🎶 Soundbath: Ease
  into a guided sound bath led by K3N-Ē\, intended to create space for pre
 sence in the body.\nNOTE: Dietary restrictions cannot be accommodated for 
 the tasting. A full list of ingredients can be provided on-site.\nWear som
 ething comfy - most of our seating is low to or on the ground. There are a
  limited number of regular seats available.\nAbout tinglesbar\ntinglesbar 
 is the world’s first dedicated ASMR spa and collective\, redefining well
 ness through immersive\, sensory-rich experiences grounded in ASMR\, creat
 ivity\, and human connection. From personalized treatments to immersive gr
 oup gatherings\, we offer multisensory escapes designed around soothing tr
 iggers (hair brushing\, back scratching\, soundscapes\, and more). A sanct
 uary to reset\, relax\, and reconnect—where mindful stimulation meets mo
 dern self-care.\nAbout K3N-Ē\nAn independent artist and musician known fo
 r moody\, R&B-infused vocal performances\, K3N-Ē uses sound and vibration
  as means to explore introspection and spirituality.
LOCATION:tinglesbar ASMR Spa
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-sensory-reset-a-sound-bath-experienc
 e-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
