  third or fourth Thursday of the month for low-key gatherings hosted by ou
 r community engagement producer Adele Lukusa.\nCome on down to Youngplace 
 at 180 Shaw St.\, Suite 314 (across from Trinity Bellwoods Park in West Qu
 een West) on Thursday\, May 28\, from 6 to 9 p.m. Then put on your best ga
 me face\, as we look to crown Toronto’s Next Top Municipal Menace — pr
