 gto.com/events/2026/05/19/original_imagee43067ee-df53-464e-b58c-1e114dc5e1
 23.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Listen to This! is a unique storytelling comedy show in downto
 wn Toronto featuring some of the city's most talented storytellers and com
 edians telling funny stories around a different theme.\nCan comedians adap
 t to having to tell a single continuous story without relying on their bit
 s and crowd work? Can storytellers focus on the funny and integrate jokes 
 into their tale? That's the challenge we put to them and the results are a
 lways incredible.\nThis month's theme is WTF: Work Time Fun: 8 hilarious s
 tories about working\, work environments\, and strange encounters on the j
 ob.\nThursday\, May 28th\, 2026. Doors at 8PM.\nFree Times Cafe (320 Colle
 ge St\, Toronto)\nLine-up and more information at:  https://www.nowlistent
 othis.ca/\nTickets at:  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/wtf-work-time-fun-a-co
 medy-x-storytelling-show-tickets-1989685296282
LOCATION:Free Times Cafe
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/wtf-work-time-fun-a-comedy-x-storytellin
 g-show-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
