 5c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Friday May 29: DAVID TORT [Extended Set]\nTAKiN | Junior Lopez
  | Chris Campos\nPortugal’s tribal house powerhouse David Tort returns t
 o Wiggle Room for a night that hits different.\nAfter tearing up the dance
 floor last year and feeling the raw energy of Wiggle Room\, David went bac
 k to the studio inspired—and now he’s bringing that energy full circle
 . Join us for the official release party of his brand new track on Wiggle 
 Room Records\, a deeply personal tribute crafted straight from the heart\,
  dedicated to the unforgettable vibe of our home\, Wiggle Room.\nThis isn
 ’t just another booking—this is a moment. A connection between artist 
 and dancefloor\, captured in sound and unleashed where it all began.\nOne 
 night. One vibe. One story.  David Tort is coming home to make Everybody W
 iggle!.\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $20\nThe Wiggler: $25\nPerforman
 ces:\n10-12  Junior Lopez\n12-1  TAKiN\n1-4  DAVID TORT\n4-close Chris Cam
 pos\nVJ SEKS\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for pr
 epaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything mentioned):\n1) The 3
 rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bottle of Stoli Vodka\n
 2) Regular Package: $700\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottl
 es of Choice (may email wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\n3) Prem
 ium Package: $900\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of C
 hoice (email wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify choice)\nTo Arrange Special
  Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission)\nATM o
 n site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\nhosted by:  Wiggle Room Records\; Wig
 gly Events\; and Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\n~ WiGGLE RESP
 ONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the right to refus
 e anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this ver
 y seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring to our attenti
 on anything you think that we should be made aware of\, such as harassment
 \, violation of personal space\, solicitation or use of controlled substan
 ces\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that may pose a risk o
 r discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask any 
 of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet space
 . Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team and event hosts\, su
 ch as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, M
 itch (lead security)\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n
 772 Dundas St West
