 l communities and are perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to mee
 t new people.\nFor games\, we have plenty to choose from including Coup\, 
 Codenames\, Splendor\, Catan\, Love Letter\, and many more! You are welcom
 e to bring games from your own collection if you wish. And all board game 
