 a6.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of Tableto
 p Role Playing Games (TTRPGs)\, this event offers something for everyone. 
 Come solo or with friends and immerse yourself in a game of Vampire: The M
 asquerade. This adventure seats up to 6 players.\nOur events are a great w
 ay to connect with members of local communities and are also perfect for f
 olks arriving in Toronto looking to make new friends.\nWhat is Vampire the
  Masquerade?: Each player is a vampire\, trying to walk the delicate line 
 between giving in to their vampiric urges and maintaining what remains of 
 their humanity. They move in different nocturnal circles than regular soci
 ety and have a whole hidden world of vampiric lineages to explore and unco
 ver.\nWhat is a One-Shot?: It is a complete story in one session of gamepl
 ay.\nGeneral Admission Tickets: Tickets to this event include a private ro
 om for you and your fellow adventurers\, access to the Left Field Brewery 
 menu and drink selections\, one of our expert Game Masters to run a full h
 ow-to-play (if any new players are in attendance) and an immersive playthr
 ough of a one-shot with accompanying music.\nPlayer Experience: Any! - Lit
 tle to no experience with the game\, or looking to build confidence\, or j
 ust have fun!\nEquipment: We will provide paper\, pencils\, and of course\
 , dice for you to borrow. We also use Chaotic Studios dice kits to help su
 pport new players in getting familiar with the different-sized dice as nee
 ded by the system.\nTo learn more\, find Changeling Gaming Events Toronto 
 on Eventbrite or click the website link to see this event (see right side 
 on desktop/above on mobile).
