 gto.com/events/2026/05/11/original_image358cfa7b-78cf-44d5-83eb-7d3c2b1a2c
 12.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A new era of basketball training is arriving in the GTA. Shoot
  360 is officially stepping onto the court in the GTA\, debuting its large
 st Canadian facility yet in Oakville on May 29\, 2026. And\, athletes in t
 he community are invited to experience it firsthand!\nLocated at 89 Loyali
 st Trail\, Unit 10\, this state-of-the-art training centre combines elite 
 coaching with AI-powered technology\, real-time analytics\, interactive dr
 ills\, and gamified development to help athletes train smarter\, compete h
 arder\, and improve faster.\nDesigned for every level of play\, from begin
 ners discovering the game to serious athletes chasing the next level\, Sho
 ot 360 delivers an immersive training experience unlike anything else in t
 he region.\nTo celebrate the grand opening\, Shoot 360 is hosting an open 
 house packed with high-energy experiences for athletes\, families\, and ba
 sketball fans\, including:\nOpen court access\nMeet-and-greets with coache
 s and trainers\nExclusive giveaways and prizes throughout the day\nFirst a
 ccess to limited founding memberships\nThe first 200 founding members will
  receive exclusive launch perks\, including a complimentary Wilson Evoluti
 on basketball and limited edition Founder apparel. Memberships range from 
 $179 to $329 per month\, with options for unlimited access\, personalized 
 coaching\, and performance tracking.\nWhether just getting started or chas
 ing the next level\, Shoot 360 is where athletes come to put in the work a
 nd see the results.\nFor more information\, visit www.shoot360basketball.c
 om\nGet a sneak peek & tour the facility:\nSunday\, May 24:  10am–4pm\nM
 onday\, May 25:  12pm–6pm\nTuesday\, May 26:  6pm–10pm\nLocation: 89 L
 oyalist Trail\, Unit 10\, Oakville\, L6H 3R1
LOCATION:Shoot 360
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/shoot-360-brings-the-future-of-basketbal
 l-training-to-oakville-grand-opening-may-29-toronto/
