 e1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Paint Night Experience at Artbox Studio Gallery – A Creative
  Evening of Connection\nStep into a warm\, inviting atmosphere and enjoy a
  unique artistic experience designed to bring people together\, whether yo
 u're coming with a partner\, friend\, family member\, or someone special i
 n your life.\nWhat to Expect:\nUpon arrival\, take a moment to explore our
  gallery and settle into the creative energy of the space. Enjoy a complim
 entary snack and beverage as you ease into an interactive painting experie
 nce designed to build connection\, creativity\, and a little bit of surpri
 se.\nBefore the event\, you’ll send us a photo of the person you’ll be
  painting. Our team will prepare your canvas in advance so you can trace y
 our image with ease when you arrive. No stress\, no pressure.\nFrom there\
 , you’ll be guided through transforming your traced outline into a fully
  painted portrait.\nAt the end of the night\, you’ll reveal your finishe
 d portraits to each other—creating a memorable and often laughter-filled
  moment of surprise.\nGuided Instruction\nYou’ll be supported step-by-st
 ep by a trained artist and instructor\, who will guide you through drawing
 \, shaping\, and painting facial features using simple techniques and appr
 oachable methods.\nAll Materials Included:\nEach guest will have their own
  canvas and easel\, along with aprons\, brushes\, paints\, and all necessa
 ry supplies.\nSnacks & Refreshments:\nEnjoy a selection of light snacks\, 
 coffee\, and refreshments included with your ticket.\nWho Should Join:\nPe
 rfect for couples\, friends\, siblings\, or any duos looking to share a cr
 eative experience together. Whether you're celebrating something special o
 r just want a unique night out\, this experience is designed for all types
  of relationships.\nAdditional Details\nMust be aged 12+ to participate. B
 est to come in pairs or be open to painting a self-portrait.\nReserve your
  spots and get ready for an evening of creativity\, connection\, and a mea
 ningful surprise reveal at the end.\nSee more events at: https://www.artbo
 xstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-portrait-painting-experience-toronto-2
 /
