 edy showcases\, Asian Comedy All-Stars\, as we mark 7 years of standout pe
 rformances and diverse voices.\nAsian Comedy All-Stars is a premier showca
 se featuring comedians from across the Asian diaspora. For seven years\, t
 he show has delivered sharp\, original comedy and built a strong following
  in Toronto. This anniversary edition brings together an especially strong
  lineup.\nFeaturing:\nHost\, Franco Nguyen\nCo-creator of CBC Gem’s Tall
 boys and a Canadian Screen Award winner\, known for sharp storytelling and
