 y All-Stars\, with a special on Amazon and OUTtv\, and appearances at the 
 Winnipeg Comedy Festival.\nRose Yule (Turkey)\nA drag performer who has en
 tertained audiences from Turkey to Canada with bold and engaging comedy.\n
 Michelle Sui (China)\nA viral performer on TikTok and Instagram known for 
 sharp\, contemporary humor.\nAbhi Pamnani (India)\nA high-energy comedian 
