 derstanding of the impacts of colonialism and anti-colonial struggles. Thi
 s discussion will focus on his influence on African cinema and on current 
 social justice movements. It will be moderated by Kevin Edmonds (Caribbean
  Studies\, University of Toronto). Speakers include Chevy Eugene (Politica
 l Science\, Dalhousie University) and others to be announced. The discussi
 on will be followed by a Q&A with the audience.\nRegister at mayworks.ca\n
 This venue has wheelchair accessible bathrooms and a wheelchair accessible
