 amily-friendly event features youth vendors\, live entertainment\, silent 
 auction\, and pop-up BBQ\, raising funds to support youth in need\nKids’
  Marketplace is a family-friendly indoor/outdoor market with handmade cre
 ations from 200+ youth entrepreneurs ages 4 through 15 from across Toronto
 .  Shop baked goods\, beverages\, jewellery\, cotton candy\, accessories\
 , sports-themed gifts\, plushies\, stickers\, wooden crafts\, snow cones\,
  slime\, key chains\, activity kits\, beauty and bath products\, toys and 
 games\, books and more.\n\nGuest will also enjoy live music by Sugar Rush
  Band\, dance performances by Abanico Latin Dance Academy\, a pop-up BBQ
  by Fearless Meat\, pizza from Pizza Pizza\, a make-your-own puppet stat
 ion from Chickadeedee\, character appearances\, playful photo opportuniti
 es\, face painting and more—offering something for all ages.\nTo date\, 
 the Kids’ Marketplace initiative has raised over $50\,000 for youth pro
 grams and charities\, including for the children residing at the Red Door 
 Family Shelter in Leslieville.\nHosted by Toronto-based non-profit organi
