 edro Quintanilla and his team. Every dish—from traditional tacos and zes
 ty ceviche to crispy croquetas and savory ropa vieja—is prepared to savo
 ry perfection.\nThe atmosphere is just as curated as the menu. With authen
 tic decor\, warm lighting\, and a lively\, welcoming energy\, Que Rico pro
