 n and milestones along her evolving journey as a performer and creator. Ta
 king place in the Aperture Room\, a light filled space on the top floor of
  a beautifully restored building just north of Yonge and Dundas Square\, e
 ach COSE event will be as much a social gathering as it will be an opportu
