BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Glow-in-the-Dark Paint Pouring on Bears & Canvas
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T173000
UID:blogto-234050@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/22/original_image52e7a2a3-20f9-46a3-a85f-be44470b66
 54.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Go outside the box at Artbox’s Glow-in-the-Dark Paint Pourin
 g Workshop and create a one-of-a-kind fluid art piece that can never be re
 created.\nEnjoy our vibrant 2-level gallery\, enjoy snacks\, coffee/tea\, 
 before diving into the mesmerizing experience of glowing paint pouring. Le
 arn essential techniques such as flip cup\, paint blowing\, and intentiona
 l pours\, along with colour mixing and flow methods—all guided by our in
 structor.\nDuration:\n• Approx. 1.5- 2 hours (depending on quantity of p
 roject choices)\nWhat’s Included:\n• Project choices include an 11x14
 ” stretched canvas and/or white fluid bear\, KAWS Figurine and fluid key
 chain.\n• Glow-in-the-dark\, neon and acrylic paints\, pouring mediums\,
  glitter\, gold/silver leaf\n• Apron and all supplies\n• Snacks\, coff
 ee\, tea\, and refreshments\nYour artwork is welcome to stay to dry safely
  or can be packed to-go\, same day. Your art will fully dry within 24 hour
 s.\nWho Can Attend:\nOpen to beginners and experienced artists alike. Ages
  10+ (ages 10–16 must attend with a paying 18+ adult).\nSee more events 
 at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
LOCATION:Artbox Studio Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/a-glow-in-the-dark-paint-pouring-on-bear
 s-canvas-toronto-34/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Annual Jewish Music Week presents - More Gefilte Fish and Chips st
 arring Daniel  Cainer
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T213000
UID:blogto-235159@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/18/original_imagefd696487-da5c-453f-a055-48ef57057f
 0f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:More Gefilte Fish and Chips - starring Daniel Cainer\nDirect f
 rom London\, UK\, Daniel brings us the full portion of his songs\, laughte
 r\,\nand heartbreakingly beautiful story. Returning for his second appeara
 nce at\nJMW\, we’re anticipating a whole plate from Daniel after just a 
 taste last year.\nWe wanted more!\n“You don’t have to be Jewish or Bri
 tish to get a kick out of Cainer’s  shtick\,”\nsays the LA Times\, but
  you do have to like beautiful music\, virtuoso piano-playing and brillian
 t lyrics. Cainer’s story-songs of Jewish family & foibles are both devas
 tatingly poignant\, and laugh-out-loud funny. He’s an extraordinary perf
 ormer\; you’ll laugh\, you’ll cry…so fasten your seat belts - it’s
  a wild\, fun ride with Daniel!\nDaniel Cainer\, British songwriter\, stor
 yteller\, and broadcaster is known for his warm\, intelligent\, funny expl
 orations of Jewish life. Daniel has performed at the Edinburgh Fringe for 
 over 20 years and enjoyed 7 off-Broadway runs in New York. His more contem
 plative songs are regularly sung by Cantors in Synagogues\nacross North Am
 erica. He is a four-time Manhattan Association of Cabarets Award  nominee 
 and has performed countless topical songs on BBC radio and TV.\nwww.daniel
 cainer.com\nColumbus  Centre\, 901 Lawrence Avenue West\,Toronto\nPurchase
  Tickets:  jmweek.ca/gefiltefish\n$25/$54/72
LOCATION:Columbus Centre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/annual-jewish-music-week-presents-more-g
 efilte-fish-and-chips-starring-daniel-cainer-toronto/
