BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Great Whisky Heist: A Mystery Scavenger Hunt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T130000
UID:blogto-234845@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/09/original_image3c26e714-7f99-40b2-9830-c6835ef07d
 a8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the Roaring Twenties to solve a century-old mys
 tery in one of Toronto's most captivating locations: the Distillery Distri
 ct. The Great Whisky Heist Mystery Scavenger Hunt challenges you and your 
 team of sleuths (2–6 players per team) to unravel a tale of thievery\, d
 eceit\, and lost fortunes. A huge shipment of whisky was stolen from the h
 istoric Gooderham & Worts Distillery and disappeared without a trace. Your
  mission is to piece together newly discovered evidence\, clues from histo
 ry\, and excerpts from a local journalist of the time Ernest Hemingway’s
  diary to determine who stole the valuable goods\, who profited\, and exac
 tly how the entire plot went down.\nThe scavenger hunt takes place entirel
 y within the pedestrian walkways of the Distillery District\, allowing you
  to fully immerse yourself in the history of the area. The event runs for 
 a total of 2 hours\, including a 1.5-hour hunt and time for introduction a
 nd conclusion.\nTickets are 39.99 + HST per person. The meeting place is i
 n front of the Go Tours/Urban Capers office at 30 Gristmill Lane near the 
 Big Red Heart.\nTickets must be purchased in advance. Click the link to le
 arn more about tickets\, how to prepare\, directions\, FAQs\, and more!\nN
 ote:  We encourage all players (or as many as possible) to bring a fully c
 harged phone with our scavenger hunt app downloaded.  Instructions are fou
 nd on the booking page. Your on-site hosts will provide you with your game
  code and further sign-in instructions upon arrival.\nThis hunt is a produ
 ct of Urban Capers Scavenger Hunts\, and any questions relating to the pro
 duct\, location\, etc. should be directed to Urban Capers at info@urbancap
 ers.com. We’re happy to help!
LOCATION:Distillery District
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-great-whisky-heist-a-mystery-scaveng
 er-hunt-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
