ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/19/original_image613e4e0a-77cf-40e8-a847-c915850646
 15.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a chill meetup and mindfulness walk in Toronto\, p
 erfect for moms and pregnant women!\nToronto Moms and Pregnant Women Meetu
 p + Mindfulness Walk\nHey mamas and mommies-to-be! Join us for a chill in-
 person meetup in Toronto Downtown where you can connect\, share stories\, 
 and enjoy a refreshing mindfulness walk. It's the perfect chance to unwind
 \, meet new friends\, and soak in some positive vibes together. Whether yo
 u're expecting or already rocking motherhood\, this event's got your back!
 \nThis meetup is purposefully scheduled on a weekend for working moms-to-b
 e and moms on maternity who would like to take some time to ourselves to g
 et out of the house while their child is at home with another caregiver.\n
 It's perfect for introverts and extraverts as our Founder will be introduc
 ing everyone to each other and helping along the way to make sure everyone
  feels welcomed.\nWe'll grab the drinks at a cafe (exact location revealed
  after registration) and go for a walk along the Waterfront.\nTo ensure th
 e quality of the event\, please include necessary info about yourself in t
 he registration.\nAbout:\nToronto Moms Club is a new club for moms and pre
 gnant ladies in Toronto Downtown established in May 2026.\nFollow us on In
 stagram: https://www.instagram.com/torontomoms.club\nCan't make it but wan
 t to know about future events? We're planning meetups on weekdays and week
 ends\, subscribe to our newsletter (subscribers get a priority invite): ht
 tps://torontomomsclub.beehiiv.com/\nFAQ:\nWhat is Toronto Moms Club?\nWe a
 re a Toronto moms community for pregnant women\, expecting moms\, new moms
 \, and mothers looking for friendship\, support\, and real-life connection
  through pregnancy\, postpartum\, maternity leave\, and early motherhood.\
 nWhere are your events located?\nOur mom events and meetups take place acr
 oss Downtown Toronto\, Canada.\nWho is this community for?\nThis community
  is for:\nPregnant women in Toronto\nExpecting moms\nNew moms\nWomen on ma
 ternity leave\nMoms with babies and toddlers\nWomen looking to meet other 
 moms in Toronto\nWomen searching for mom groups in Toronto or postpartum s
 upport
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-moms-and-pregnant-women-meetup-m
 indfulness-walk-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
