 gto.com/events/2026/05/11/original_image27ad2a4e-73b9-4efd-bf95-7623485209
 01.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Grab your favourite Gleeks\, test your knowledge\, and compete
  in a night dedicated to one of television’s most iconic musical series!
 \nStep into the halls of William McKinley High for a night of Glee Trivia 
 at Hemingway’s on Monday\, June 1st.\nFrom unforgettable performances an
 d iconic mashups to Sue Sylvester insults\, Nationals drama\, and emotiona
 l character moments\, this trivia night will challenge even the most dedic
 ated fans. Whether you know every competition setlist by heart or still re
 visit your favourite episodes for comfort rewatches\, this is your chance 
 to prove you belong in New Directions.\nGather your team\, enjoy great foo
 d and drinks\, and get ready for a high energy evening full of music\, lau
 ghs\, chaos\, and a little bit of show choir drama.\nTRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 
 Doors open at 6:00 PM. Arrive early\, grab a themed drink\, and get settle
 d in.\n❓ First question at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be late.\n🧠 Three r
 ounds of trivia\, about 15 questions each.\n🏆 The top three teams win a
  Hem’s gift card valued between $50 and $100.
