 41.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Beavers are taking over Old Town Toronto\nThe Old Town Toronto
  BIA is inviting locals and visitors to explore the city through The Great
  Beaver Quest\, a free\, family-friendly art crawl and scavenger hunt runn
 ing June through August 2026!\nPresented in partnership with STEPS Public 
 Art\, the neighbourhood will transform into a vibrant public art experienc
 e featuring 48 four-foot-tall beaver sculptures\, each inspired by one of 
 the participating countries in the tournament.\nWhat: The Great Beaver Que
 st\nWhen: Starting June 1\nWhere: Find all 48 beavers scattered across Old
  Town Toronto\nWhy & How: Download the app\, find the beavers and win priz
 es from participating Old Town Toronto businesses\nDesigned as both a disc
 overy experience and a celebration of Toronto’s diversity\, the Quest en
 courages participants to explore Old Town’s vibrant mix of historic land
 marks\, independent retailers\, and standout dining spots while tracking d
 own each sculpture.\nThe initiative is supported by the City of Toronto th
 rough the Community Celebration Support Fund and reflects a broader commit
 ment to vibrant\, main street cultural programming.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-great-beaver-quest-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
