BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Necromancer's Tower - A Premium Dungeons & Dragons One-Shot Ex
 perience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260601T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260601T223000
UID:blogto-234204@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/26/original_imagec5a8df80-a190-42cd-ba94-69585e0ee0
 43.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of Tableto
 p Role Playing Games (TTRPGs)\, this event offers something for everyone. 
 Come solo or with friends and immerse yourself in a game of Dungeons & Dra
 gons (D&D). This adventure seats up to 6 players.\nOur events are a great 
 way to connect with members of local communities and are also perfect for 
 folks arriving in Toronto looking to make new friends.\nWhat is Dungeons &
  Dragons?: D&D is a Role Playing Game (RPG) where players work together to
  create a story. Each person acts as a character in the story while the Du
 ngeon Master (DM) acts as the referee and guide. Together\, players will s
 olve dilemmas\, explore dungeons\, find treasure\, and perhaps encounter a
  dragon!\nWhat is a One-Shot?: It is a complete story in one session of ga
 meplay.\nGeneral Admission Tickets: Tickets to this event include a privat
 e room for you and your fellow adventurers\, a full food & drinks menu\, o
 ne of our expert Dungeon Masters to run a how-to-play (if any new players 
 are in attendance) and an immersive playthrough of a one-shot with accompa
 nying music. Tickets also include access to the Snakes & Lattes Annex boar
 d game library\, if you would like to sit and play before the adventure be
 gins.\nPlayer Experience: Any! - Little to no experience with the game\, o
 r looking to build confidence\, or just have fun!\nEquipment: We will prov
 ide paper\, pencils\, and of course\, dice for you to borrow. We also use 
 Chaotic Studios dice kits to help support new players in getting familiar 
 with the different-sized dice.\nTo learn more\, find Changeling Gaming Eve
 nts Toronto on Eventbrite or click the website link to see this event (see
  right side on desktop/above on mobile).
LOCATION:Snakes and Lattes
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-necromancers-tower-a-premium-dungeon
 s-dragons-one-shot-experience-toronto-4/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
