 25.jpg
DESCRIPTION:​Join us for an evening of swapping\, stitching\, and social
 izing as part of Toronto Climate Week! This isn’t your typical clothing 
 swap because we believe building community and sharing skills are also ess
 ential aspects of a circular economy.\n​For the clothing swap\, we sugge
 st bringing about 10 items (clothes\, shoes\, or accessories)\, preferably
  seasonal items\, clean and in good condition - think something you’d be
  happy to receive! Any items leftover at the end of the swap will be donat
 ed to New Circles.\n​For the mending lab\, we encourage you to bring an 
 item or two in need of minor repair\, perhaps a sock that needs darning\, 
 a button that needs to be reattached or jeans requiring a small patch. If 
 you find something at the swap that needs a small adjustment\, we may be a
 ble to help with that too!
