DESCRIPTION:Join Opera 5 for a fresh and intimate double bill of Puccini
 ’s Suor Angelica and Gianni Schicchi\, presented with a new chamber redu
 ction by Music Director Evan Mitchell. Directed by Jessica Derventzis\, th
 is pairing brings together some of Canada’s most celebrated opera artist
 s alongside Opera 5’s Portfolio Artist Interns.\nThis production shines 
 a light on the emotional range of Puccini’s work: from the quiet\, achin
 g spirituality of Suor Angelica to the sharp wit and joyful chaos of Giann
 i Schicchi. By weaving emerging voices with seasoned performers in an inti
 mate musical setting\, Opera 5 offers a moving\, funny\, and deeply human 
 evening that highlights the power of ensemble storytelling and incredible 
 Canadian opera talent.\nDirector - Jessica Derventzis\nMusic Director - Ev
 an Mitchell\nProduction Design - Carlyn Rahusaar Routledge\nLighting Desig
 n - Siobhan Sleath\nSuor Angelica - Rachel Krehm\nLa Zia Principessa - Kri
