 egends podcast will keep the team on task as they take you behind the scen
 es of the MM & MMM glory days from the 80s\, 90s and beyond.\nGet involved
  in the audience Q&A and stick around afterwards for a meet-and-greet with
  Denise\, Rick and Bill! Denise and Bill’s books will also be available 
 for purchase after the show!\nA leader in Canadian cultural industries for
  over 50 years\, Denise is a former president of Sony Music Canada\, vice-
 president of MuchMusic and MuchMoreMusic\, and executive director of CBC E
 nglish radio. A member of the Order of Canada\, she got her on-air start i
 n 1985 anchoring MuchMusic’s “Rockflash News” and then producing/hos
 ting MuchMusic’s “The New Music.” Her memoir is entitled Fearless as
  Possible (Under the Circumstances).\nRick Campanelli literally went from 
 ‘Rick the Temp’ to ‘Rick the Franchise’ at MuchMusic\, after winni
 ng a national hosting contest in 1994. He followed this up as an original 
 host on Entertainment Tonight Canada and multiple tv/radio jobs before his
  current gig on CityTV's Breakfast Television.\nSince first stepping in fr
 ont of MuchMusic’s national cameras in 1992\, Bill Welychka has become o
 ne of Canada’s most enduring\, recognizable and respected television per
 sonalities. He is MuchMusic and MuchMoreMusic’s longest-running VJ. He h
 as documented his career in the best-selling memoir A Happy Has-Been: Exci
 ting Times and Lessons Learned by One of Canada’s Foremost Entertainment
  Journalists.\nAndrew Applebaum is the host of the Toronto Legends podcast
 \, with 350 one-on-one interviews with well-known personalities from sport
 s\, broadcasting\, business\, music and media. He hosts well-known persona
 lities at live events for libraries\, community centres\, book launches an
 d other private & public institutions.\n$38.37\nJune 4\, 2026\n120 minutes
 \n19:00\nDavide De Simone Performance Hall\n13+\nBook your tickets for The
  Aurora Museum & Archives Presents MuchMusic Memories with Denise Donlon\,
  Rick Campanelli & Bill Welychka\, hosted by Andrew Applebaum\n4th June 20
 26 7:00pm\nAdmission Time: 18:30\nhttps://boxoffice.auroratownsquare.ca/ev
 ent/109:197/109:269/?fbclid=IwY2xjawRrz_VleHRuA2FlbQIxMQBzcnRjBmFwcF9pZBAy
 MjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEenNb6Uy5EFIzkdjjMt1GlI5ur_2IDUzmuD7DwGirGQ5wURzS7w5
 B_YtMDUwE_aem_Ca4mffK8vYG3jjwhjytX4g
LOCATION:Davide De Simone Performance Hall
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/muchmusic-memories-with-bill-welychka-de
 nise-donlon-rick-campanelli-toronto/
