 t survival.\nRunning: June - November 2026 every weekend from 11AM - 4PM\n
 Tickets:\nGeneral Admission: $66.95 + HST\nChild (4-14): $36.05 + HST\nSec
 ret Society Tier: $87.55 + HST (advanced puzzle path)\nChildren 3 and unde
 r: Free\nAdvance booking recommended.\nLearn more at secretcityadventures.
