BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intrigue at the Museum: A Mystery Scavenger Hunt at ROM
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T163000
UID:blogto-234843@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/09/original_image93ed810c-5b27-4e58-a924-1a05a61e2a
 2c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand\, our classic ROM mystery scavenger hun
 t returns!\nThere has been a mysterious murder\, and the museum's collecti
 ons hold the key.  As you gather clues\, you’ll begin to piece together 
 a tale of greed\, lust\, pride\, and revenge. Working in teams\, sleuths t
 ravel through the museum's galleries solving whodunnit\, where\, and with 
 what. Will your team solve the mystery before the clock runs out?\nTickets
  are $47.50 +hst per person and include admission to the Royal Ontario Mus
 eum. Tickets must be purchased in advance. Click the link to learn more ab
 out tickets\, how to prepare\, directions\, FAQs\, and more!\nIf you have 
 a ROM Membership\, please call us for a discount code.\nNote:  We encourag
 e all players (or as many as possible) to bring a fully charged phone with
  our scavenger hunt app downloaded.  Instructions are found on the booking
  page. Your on-site hosts will provide you with your game code and further
  sign-in instructions upon arrival.\nThis hunt is a product of Urban Caper
 s Scavenger Hunts\, and any questions relating to the product\, location\,
  etc. should be directed to Urban Capers at info@urbancapers.com. We’re 
 happy to help!
LOCATION:Royal Ontario Museum
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/intrigue-at-the-museum-a-mystery-scaveng
 er-hunt-at-rom-toronto-10/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:It's Dorothy!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T171500
UID:blogto-235040@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/14/original_image08edf95c-58b4-4357-bfd9-34cafed38f
 91.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Since her first appearance in L. Frank Baum’s The Wonderful 
 Wizard of Oz in 1900\, Dorothy Gale has enchanted generations with her cou
 rage\, curiosity and determined search for home. What is it about her stor
 y that still feels so relatable\, especially to those whose experiences ar
 en’t always centred? It’s Dorothy! invites audiences on a dazzling jou
 rney through Dorothy’s enduring cultural legacy\, tracing her profound i
 mpact on women\, folks of colour\, and LGBTQ+ communities. The film weaves
  a poignant portrait of Judy Garland’s life and her connection to those 
 who see themselves in Dorothy\, blending mesmerizing archival footage from
  Garland’s career and the classic 1939 musical film The Wizard of Oz wit
 h insights from contemporary voices including Ashanti\, Margaret Cho\, Len
 a Waithe and John Waters. At once fantastical and deeply human\, It’s Do
 rothy! reminds us that through self-love\, the celebration of imagination\
 , and the radical power of belonging\, there truly is no place like home. 
 Simone Estrin\, Hot Docs
LOCATION:Hot Docs Cinema
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/its-dorothy-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
