 sychological thriller genre! New York Times Bestselling author\, Shari Lap
 ena\, will be taking the stage to discuss the book that started it all\, T
 he Couple Next Door. Following a young couple who seem to have it all\, th
 ings take a turn when their baby is kidnapped from their home while they a
 re next door at a dinner party and their lives begin to unravel\, revealin
 g lies and a shocking twist. Join the author as she talks about writing si
 nce the book\, how the genre has changed\, and what is to come.\nFeaturing
  readings from Samantha M. Bailey\, Hannah Mary McKinnon\, and Bianca Mara
 is\nModerated by Nita Prose
