 orist cyber-attack triggers a meltdown at a nuclear power plant in China\,
  imprisoned hacker Nicholas Hathaway (Chris Hemworth) is recruited by gove
 rnment agencies to infiltrate an international cybercrime network. Caught 
 between an old friend\, a new lover\, and the warring governments of China
  and the United States\, Hathaway must act fast if he wants to keep his fr
 eedom – and his life!\nHosts Marc & Lacey will be joined by critic\, pod
 caster\, and # 1 Blackhat defender in the GTA\, Josh Lewis! Comrade Josh w
 ill serve as the film’s defence attorney\, whereas the hosts will provid
 e the prosecution.\nBut in the end\, only the jury (audience) can decide\;
  is it an Underrated Masterpiece\, or a Properly Rated Fiasco?
