 aa.jpg
DESCRIPTION:PushPULL Dance Toronto presents Season 22\, Unframed. Step int
 o a playful\, heartfelt tour of the dance equivalent of an art gallery—w
 here movement meets brushstroke\, shadow\, and light. You will find vivid 
 tableaux and kinetic “sculptures” that reveal the living connection be
 tween dance and visual arts. Explore how choreography re-frames what we se
 e\, feel\, and share. Unframed features a variety of dance styles\, includ
 ing contemporary\, ballet\, tap\, swing and jazz dance.\nPushPULL is a com
 munity company of diverse adult dancers who love the art form of dance. In
  spite of our busy lives\, we all continue to make space for the artistic 
 process and find time to create and collaborate on an annual dance show.\n
 Online sales for Unframed close 5 hours before the start of each show. Onc
 e the online sale has closed\, any leftover tickets can be purchased at th
 e Box Office at the Fairview Library Theatre\, which opens one hour before
  each show.\nThe venue is fully wheelchair accessible. Please let us know 
 if you have seating accessibility needs when you book your ticket.\nImport
 ant note: This is not a Toronto Public Library event.
