 \nBooty Call Music & Groovin’ in the Park proudly present a heavyweight 
 night of deep disco\, soulful house\, and dancefloor magic. On Saturday\, 
 June 13th\, 2026 \, we bring Brooklyn to Toronto as JKriv —producer\, DJ
