BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Miniature Soccer Build Workshop - Little Field\, Big Adventure
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T120000
UID:blogto-235210@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/19/original_imagec7ce3eff-eeee-4d93-9439-2aa43d7d7a
 58.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Build the beautiful game you love in miniature.\nCreated in pa
 rtnership with BMO\, this hands‑on soccer experience is designed for kid
 s\, families and soccer fans alike. Little Field\, Big Adventure is a one
 ‑hour workshop where guests build and customize their own miniature socc
 er scene\, complete with a soccer net and country flag inspired by the tea
 m they cheer for. Each participant leaves with a finished mini soccer scen
 e to take home as a meaningful keepsake.\nGuests are encouraged to wear th
 eir favourite team jersey for a chance to be scanned and transformed into 
 a 3/4" Little Me 3D figure\, which can be added to their scene once 3D pri
 nted. It's a fun way to put yourself right into the game. Workshop partici
 pants will receive a special promo code for additional savings on the 3/4
 ” Little Me.\nWhether you’re a local or visiting for a big event takin
 g place in Toronto\, this weather‑proof experience is an easy addition t
 o your summer day.\nThis workshop is suitable for children 6+\nChildren 12
  and under require adult supervision. Parents are welcome to sit with thei
 r child during the workshop\, even if they are not participating.\nWorksho
 p Cost: $20* per participant. *Admission: Valid general admission is requi
 red and must be purchased separately from the workshop ticket.\nTotal Cost
