BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Masquerade & Mayhem Double Feature
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T170000
UID:blogto-234593@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/04/original_image7539cf1d-d93a-4076-858a-4c9f711f4e
 ed.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Two classic comedies. Two stories of disguise\, performance\, 
 and what\nhappens when identity refuses to stay neatly contained. From the
  sun-\nsoaked chaos of Saint-Tropez to the rapid-fire brilliance of classi
 c\nHollywood\, La Cage aux Folles and Some Like It Hot use humour to push\
 nboundaries\, challenge expectations\, and deliver some of the most\nmemor
 able characters in film history. Smart\, stylish\, and still ahead of thei
 r\ntime\, this is comedy with something to say\, and exactly the kind of d
 ouble\nfeature that comes alive on the big screen with a crowd!
LOCATION:Paradise Theatres
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/masquerade-mayhem-double-feature-toronto
 /
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
