 ter Science\, Information Technology\, Robotics\, Artificial Intelligence\
 , and Data Science\, Drive Digital Innovation and System Advancements\, sh
 aping the future of technological applications and interdisciplinary colla
 borations in these dynamic conferences.\nJoin us at ICAET2026 in Florence\
 , Italy for a truly unforgettable experience!\nBest Regards\,\nLakshmi Pra
 sanna | Program Coordinator\nICAET2026
