 c lipsync performances that blend pop music and pop culture with elements 
 of camp cranked to the max\nVIZA has been dazzling audiences across Canada
  with her sharp wit and even sharper tongue for over 18 years. She’s bee
 n featured on JFL Toronto\, JFL Vancouver\, CBC Gem\, CRAVE\, and Sirius X
 M. In February 2026\, she was selected to be a cast member of Season 7 of 
 CBC’s New\nWave Of Stand-up\, making history as the first drag queen to 
 achieve this honour. She’s been fortunate enough to work with and open f
 or multiple touring acts including Caroline Rhea\, James Adomion\, Nico Ca
 rney\, Kevin Sullivan\, and Michael Henry\nDon’t miss your chance to exp
 erience Exhausted Showgirl LIVE!\nTickets are $13 plus tax in advance\, $1
 5 plus tax at the door
