UID:blogto-234834@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/08/original_imagefed4f7a5-0997-4654-939b-00b7d215dd
 38.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us at GROUND CONTROL. This edition is for sapphics 30 yea
 rs or older. Always trans and enby inclusive.\nTired of the apps? Is Toron
 to a tough place to meet new people? Try this! QUESTIONABLE is trivia with
  a twist….\nAlready have what you're looking for but have a friend who y
 ou want to set up? Come pitch them!\nThis is our SAPPHIC EDITION. Always t
 rans and enby inclusive.\nCome be part of the series that has become the s
 tuff of legends.....\nTHIS IS OUR 30+ EDITION for GROWN sapphics who are 3
 0 and up!\nThis event is at\nGROUND CONTROL\n1279 Queen Street West\nDoors
  at 7:30pm\nFirst Round starts at 8pm\nHosted by your faves:\n@chaodykes\n
 How does it work?\nYou will be put in a team with 5-6 people you don’t k
 now.\nThere will be 2 rounds of trivia. Each round\, you will change teams
 !\nThere will be a DJ In the lounge after the event so you can stay after 
 the event to keep the conversations going!\nWhat does ‘single’ mean?\n
 'Single’ means you are open to connecting with other people for love\, l
 ust or friendship.\nMaybe you will meet your soulmate! Maybe you will meet
  your new best friend! Maybe you will make out in the bathroom! Maybe you 
 will add a lover to your rotation! Maybe you will find a gaming buddy. Que
 er love is EXPANSIVE. Let's be open to a variety of connections.\nThe even
 t is poly-friendly\, slut-friendly\, monogamy-friendly\, ace-friendly. If 
 you can’t leave your judgment of others at home\, then you should stay h
 ome.\nCost\nWe are doing a sliding scale of $7-$25.\nAnd you get a $2 cred
 it at the bar with this ticket purchase!\nAll funds are going to Glad Day 
 Lit to support 2SLGBTQ artists and community events.\nSchedule\n7:30pm - D
 oors Open\, you get put into your first team\n8pm - First Round starts\n10
 pm ISH - Expected end\, but you can stay to socialize!\nHow will you make 
 the teams?\nThe teams will mostly be random.\nHow many people can attend?\
 nOur max number for this event is 85 people.This event can sell out and th
 e lower price tickets sell out first\, so act fast.\nYou can email any que
 stions to have to: vip@gladday.ca
LOCATION:Ground Control
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/questionable-sapphic-over-30-edition-que
 er-singles-trivia-toronto-3/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
