DESCRIPTION:The Throbbing Rose Collective has confirmed that the seventh e
 dition of Nuit Rose will take place June 18–20\, 2026\, with the main ev
 ent on Saturday\, June 20 from 6:00 PM throughout Toronto’s Church–Wel
 lesley Village.\nThe festival’s return theme is REWILDING — an invitat
 ion to reclaim\, reimagine\, and reanimate queer space through light\, sou
 nd\, installation\, live performance\, and community activation. Artists w
 ho responded to a call for submissions will be selected through a jury pro
 cess in the coming weeks. First conceived in 2014 as part of World Pride i
 n Toronto\, Nuit Rose grew from a single-night grassroots event into one o
 f Canada’s most recognized queer art festivals\, presenting over 300 pro
 jects across six editions between 2014 and 2019.
