 ostics\, molecular biology\, and digital health technologies. Held in the 
 vibrant city of Paris\, this prestigious two-day event is designed to show
 case how pathology is leading the transformation of healthcare through pre
 cision medicine\, predictive analytics\, and global disease management.\nJ
 oin a global audience of pathologists\, oncologists\, research scientists\
 , laboratory professionals\, and medical technology innovators as they exp
 lore next-generation solutions that are redefining diagnostic accuracy and
  improving patient outcomes worldwide.
