BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1 night of ICONS Only with SYDNEY BLU
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260626T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260627T050000
UID:blogto-234976@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/13/original_imagedb1d8084-2bb5-47b7-aba2-de44587d05
 8a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Friday June 26: ICONS ONLY\nSYDNEY BLU | Jules Bangsworth | Sl
 ater Manzo | Kasey Riot | DJ RAE | JAX\nToronto’s queer underground retu
 rns for the second edition of ICONA\, a night dedicated to dance floor lib
 eration\, bold self-expression\, and the icons shaping underground culture
 .\nICONS ONLY brings together a lineup of boundary-pushing selectors and p
 roducers who have come to SERVE. Expect an unforgettable night of house\, 
 techno\, queer energy\, and late-night chaos inside one of Toronto’s mos
 t beloved dance spaces.\nCome dressed like the main character\, because yo
 u are the main character henny.\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe
  Wiggler: $30\nPerformances:\n10-11  Jax\n11-12  DJ RAE\n12-1  Slater Manz
 o\n1-2:30 SYDNEY BLU\n2:30-3:30  Jules Bangsworth\n3:30-close  Kasey Riot\
 nVJ SEKS\nQueer-centered space\nAllies welcome\nARTIST BIOS\nSydney Blu @s
 ydneyblu\nA globally recognized DJ\, producer\, and label owner\, Sydney B
 lu has been a driving force in underground house and techno for over a dec
 ade. Known for releases on deadmau5’s mau5trap imprint and her own Blu M
 usic label\, she’s played iconic clubs and festivals worldwide while bui
 lding a reputation for deep\, energetic\, and emotionally charged sets. A 
 true Canadian electronic music icon.\nSlater Manzo @slatermanzo\nToronto-b
 ased producer and DJ Slater Manzo blends infectious grooves\, driving bass
 lines\, and underground house sensibilities into high-energy sets designed
  for sweaty dance floors. Known throughout the city’s queer and warehous
 e scenes\, Manzo brings an unmistakable vibe rooted in rhythm\, connection
 \, and late-night momentum.\nDJ RAE @rachelmolenda\nDJ RAE delivers uplift
 ing\, soulful\, and high-vibrational dance music experiences that fuse hou
 se\, disco\, and feel-good energy. A staple within Toronto’s inclusive n
 ightlife community\, RAE is known for creating spaces that celebrate freed
 om\, joy\, movement\, and queer connection through music.\nJax @jaxonair\n
 Jax is a Toronto-based DJ known for high-energy\, emotionally charged sets
  that blend house\, tech house\, Latin rhythms\, and underground club ener
 gy into an unforgettable dance floor experience. A staple within the city
 ’s queer nightlife scene\, Jax brings vibrant charisma behind the decks 
 and a deep understanding of crowd connection.\nKasey Riot @kaseyriot_\nKas
 ey Riot is a fearless selector with a love for heavy grooves\, underground
  textures\, and emotionally charged dance floors. Blending house\, techno\
 , and rave-inspired sounds\, their sets are immersive\, dynamic\, and buil
 t for dancers who want to lose themselves in the music.\nJules Bangsworth 
 @julesbangsworth\nICONA Mom and DJ\, Jules has been a steady force in Toro
 nto’s queer nightlife scene\, she brings eclectic taste\, magnetic energ
 y\, and unapologetic attitude behind the decks. Expect genre-blurring sele
 ctions\, playful chaos\, and a set that keeps the floor moving.\n#ICONSONL
 Y #ICONA #QueerToronto #TorontoRaves #WiggleRoomToronto #HouseMusic #Techn
 o #QueerParty #TorontoNightlife\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBe
 ats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = everything me
 ntioned):\n1) The 3rd Wheel: $363\nincludes: 3 General Admissions\; 1 Bott
 le of (BG) Vodka on Special\n2) Regular Package: $700\nincludes: 6 General
  Admissions\; 2 Regular Bottles of Choice (may email wigglyevents@gmail.co
 m to specify choice)\n3) Premium Package: $900\nincludes: 6 General Admiss
 ions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choice (email wigglyevents@gmail.com to specif
 y choice)\nTo Arrange Special Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold sepa
 rately from admission)\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\nhosted b
 y:  ICONA\; Sunshine Frequencies\; Wiggly Events\; and Wiggle Room Toronto
 \n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the
  right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. W
 e take this very seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring
  to our attention anything you think that we should be made aware of\, suc
 h as harassment\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or use of con
 trolled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that ma
 y pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word BA
 NANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a saf
 e\, quiet space. Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team and e
 vent hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\,
  Tyler Hill\, Monique\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\
 n772 Dundas St West
LOCATION:Wiggle Room
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/1-night-of-icons-only-with-sydney-blu-to
 ronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
