 a landmark milestone: 65 years as Canada’s largest and longest-running j
 uried contemporary outdoor art fair.\nEach summer\, TOAF brings together o
 ver 400 visual artists and 170\,000 visitors at Nathan Phillips Square\, t
 ransforming Toronto’s civic heart into a vibrant gathering place for art
 \, conversation\, and discovery. This milestone year honours the long arc 
 of artistic careers and the enduring power of experiencing art together in
  public.
