 82.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A celebration of one of the most iconic voices in violin histo
 ry\, featuring Timothy Chooi performing on the legendary 1714 “Dolphin
 ” Stradivarius\, famously played by Jascha Heifetz\, alongside the incom
 parable Jon Kimura Parker. From the electrifying drama of the Vitali Chaco
 nne and the elegance of Gluck’s Mélodie\, to the high-wire brilliance o
 f Corigliano’s Red Violin Caprices\, the first half captures the fire\, 
 precision\, and charisma that defined the Heifetz legacy. After intermissi
 on\, Franck’s timeless Sonata brings the evening to its emotional summit
 .
