DESCRIPTION:Houseplants 101: How to Choose (and Keep Alive) the Right Plan
 ts for Your Space\nNo green thumb? No problem. Houseplants 101 is a fun\, 
 beginner-friendly seminar that covers all the essentials of indoor plant c
 are and plant styling. Learn how to choose the right plants for your light
  conditions\, care for them properly\, and avoid the most common mistakes\
 , so you can fill your home with lush greenery with confidence.\nYou’ll 
 walk away with clarity\, practical knowledge\, and a new appreciation for 
 how plants can elevate your home. We’ll also highlight three great start
 er plants for bright\, medium\, and low-light spaces\, so no matter your s
 etup\, you’ll find something that thrives.\nFor more details & to sign u
 p\, visit our website www.angasfarm.ca
