UID:blogto-234543@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/03/original_imaged5f98bf5-286f-4e62-9cc4-8264e55569
 01.jpg
DESCRIPTION:An Afternoon in the Orchard | A Floral Experience in Toronto\n
 Join us for a beautifully curated summer afternoon in our apple orchard at
  Anga’s Farm & Nursery in Etobicoke\, Toronto. Set on one of Toronto’s
  last operational\, family-run farms\, this experience offers a peaceful e
 scape that feels like the countryside\, right in the city.\nDesigned with 
 a relaxed\, garden-inspired atmosphere\, this is not a traditional worksho
 p but an elevated social gathering to be enjoyed at your own pace. Created
  to foster creativity\, connection\, and a sense of well-being\, this expe
 rience invites you to slow down\, engage with others\, and enjoy a meaning
 ful afternoon surrounded by nature.\nAs part of the experience\, you’ll 
 have the opportunity to hand-pick a selection of fresh flowers directly fr
 om our garden\, adding a personal and seasonal touch to your bouquet.\nYou
 ’ll then create your own floral arrangement using a curated selection of
  fresh blooms\, with light guidance from our team. Throughout the experien
 ce\, enjoy refreshing summer mocktails and a thoughtfully styled charcuter
 ie spread\, all set within our orchard.\nFor more details & to register\, 
 please visit our website! www.angasfarm.ca
LOCATION:Anga's Farm & Nursery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/angas-farm-an-afternoon-in-the-orchard-a
 -floral-workshop-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
