 ch textures to the earthy intensity of Kodály’s Duo\, this program unfo
 lds in layers of colour and heat. It culminates in Tchaikovsky’s sweepin
 g Souvenir de Florence — music that feels sun-soaked\, passionate\, and 
 gloriously alive. An evening of warmth\, lyricism\, and bold expressive fi
 re\, this programme celebrates the radiant heart of chamber music at its m
 ost vibrant.
LOCATION:Walter Hall
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/toronto-summer-music-souvenir-de-florenc
 e-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
