 er! Prices will go up!\n🎶 Hottest DJs\n🎤 Interactive games and netwo
 rking activities\n🎁 Prizes & giveaways\n🎨 Dress Code: Yellow\, Red\,
  or Green! Show off your style\n🎟️ Click the link here to get your ti
 ckets: https://bit.ly/4egoxh9\n📧 For purchase by E-Transfer\, send to: 
