 ive — with 40+ artists including Saturday headliner Feral Minks. Beyond 
 the music: festival camping\, a brand-new immersive arts zone (WonderGroun
 d)\, Kids Zone\, Health & Wellness Zone\, Vendor Village\, and late-night 
 sessions around the campfire. All-ages. Community-rooted. One hour north o
 f Toronto.
