DESCRIPTION:To tackle one of the most critical issues of our day—the glo
 bal mental health crisis—the Mental Health World Conference (MHWC 2026) 
 is a premier international forum that brings together experts\, policymake
 rs\, researchers\, and mental health professionals from around the world.\
 nThis year's theme\, "Advancing Global Mental Wellness Through Science\, S
 ystems\, and Solidarity\," reflects a renewed interest in working together
  across national borders\, disciplines\, and sectors. From digital innovat
 ion to trauma recovery\, and policy reform to system change\, MHWC 2026 of
 fers a powerful platform to impact mental health agendas around the world.
